/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.216 0.275 0.345 rg
42.5196850393700814 696.4726771653542983 Td
(to timber pest attack. The inspection is carried out by a qualified timber pest inspector in accordance with the applicable Australian Standard and) Tj
