/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.216 0.275 0.345 rg
42.5196850393700814 635.2443307086614368 Td
(This inspection covers subterranean termites \(white ants\), drywood termites, wood borers, and wood decay fungi \(rot\) where evidence is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.216 0.275 0.345 rg
42.5196850393700814 623.0553543307087239 Td
(observable in accessible areas. These are the timber pests defined in AS 4349.3-2010.) Tj
